      "target_fact_id": "8ad141b0-df3f-42d4-b7e4-4d0bc1f42279",
      "reconciliation_explanation": "The RBI Annual Report states India's foreign exchange reserves at US$668.3 billion as of end-March 2025. The IMF Article IV Consultation states reserves at US$668 billion for March 2025. The US$300 million difference (0.04%) is purely a rounding convention \u2014 the RBI reports to one decimal place while the IMF rounds to the nearest billion. Both figures refer to the same reserve pool held by the Reserve Bank of India as of the same date. Verdict: CORROBORATED with confidence 0.98.",
